hint_tooltip = "Property: restrict_type

If set, restricts this slot to a specific ship type.

Vanilla uses \"fission\" for fission reactor ships, and \"fusion-dec\" for the EIME, however this can be whatever is set in the `shipType` property of a ship scene."
